9	/**
10	 * Rejects (409) a create-owner request that would join an existing household. Because the household
11	 * is now keyed on the computed {@code householdId} (a pure function of the normalized last name and
12	 * postcode, see {@link OwnerIdentity#householdId}), owners sharing a last name and postcode are the
13	 * same household. So a second such owner is a household duplicate unless it declares
14	 * {@code sharesHousehold}, in which case this block is bypassed and it is created as a declared
15	 * household member.
